          "translations": {
            "en-GB": {
              "text": "A suite of gloriously pointless browser mini-apps: translate text to emoji, touch virtual grass, squeeze a screaming chicken, commune with god, paint potatoes, fence with slugs, blow up balloons with your voice, and play as a shelf-smashing cat.",
